00:20:03.158 --> 00:20:14.212
then the blue plot at the same point has an approximation of 1 * 10^-6.

00:20:14.212 --> 00:20:18.095
A few orders of magnitude. We earned a couple of orders here.

00:20:18.095 --> 00:20:23.200
But, in truth, we had to add all of this.

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.532
Good.

00:20:27.072 --> 00:20:29.750
Now, by the way, we can look at the plan.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:33.708
