00:20:45.065 --> 00:20:53.403
Realize that the chosen path is wrong and try simply changing the numerator and denominator.

00:20:53.403 --> 00:20:59.781
Then, for the sake of interest, we'll derive another formula for Pi from this approximation.

00:20:59.781 --> 00:21:02.120
