00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:10.327
Then we will learn the truth about what is really at stake here.

00:21:10.327 --> 00:21:16.126
What infinite series of m is involved.

00:21:18.841 --> 00:21:21.030
And we will start thinking about this truth.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:27.398
This truth will be got through the Taylor series expansion by some function.

00:21:27.398 --> 00:21:35.561
But the coefficients in this expansion will be unknown to us in the form of a formula.

