00:34:18.362 --> 00:34:20.833
That is, we followed the right path.

00:34:20.833 --> 00:34:25.493
Got a certain formula for the expansion of the inverted fraction.

00:34:25.493 --> 00:34:29.288
But here we tried to go back to the old variant and see,

00:34:29.288 --> 00:34:33.390
